**Yuu.** A monster-loving boy searching for his missing sister, aided
by a mysterious wolf-like companion. Yuu's beloved older sister
vanished without a trace -- and, stranger still, everyone around him
seems to have forgotten she ever existed. Chasing a shadowy figure
fleeing the scene, Yuu instead found a caged, wolf-like creature left
behind: Fenrir. Certain it was fate, Yuu freed him, and the two have
been inseparable since, determined to find Yuu's sister together.
Endlessly curious and unable to leave a wrong unrighted, Yuu's good
nature gets him into trouble as often as it wins him friends -- Fenrir
very much included. *Companion +4 (Fenrir), Evasive +1, Intuitive +1,
Iron-Willed +1, Knowledge +3 (Monsters), Knowledge +3 (Video Games),
Quick +2, Unique Ability +1 (Trust), Vigorous +1; Ageism −2,
Compulsion −2 (Finding Things Out), Guardian −2 (Sister), Impulsive
−1, Kind-Hearted −1, Wanted −3 (Men in Black).* Struggle (Affinity:
Normal Type): Roll 2, DX 1, End 0. Though he doesn't have any special
moves, Yuu can still put up a fight if he needs to. Defense 5. Health
40, Endurance 50. TV 9.

**Companion: Fenrir.** *Attack +3, Combat Expert +2, Quick +3, Tough
+2, Vigorous +3; Bizarre Appearance −2, Fear −2 (Enclosed Spaces),
Guardian −1 (Yuu), Mute −2, Servitude −1 (Yuu), Short-Tempered −1.*
Maul (Affinity: Normal Type): Roll 4, DX 4, End 0. Fenrir leaps at the
target and attacks with beastly fury. Quick Attack (Stunning;
Requirement: Trust +1 (−5)): Roll 4, DX 4, End 5. Fenrir strikes
repeatedly in the blink of an eye. Lance (Armor Piercing x2, Effective
x3; Delayed, Requirement: Trust +2 (−10)): Roll 4, DX 7, End 10.
Fenrir charges up a skewering headbutt. Lightning Rod (Affinity:
Lightning; Effective x6; Requirement: Trust +3 (−15)): Roll 4, DX 10,
End 15. A bolt of lightning comes down from above, charging Fenrir's
horn with power. Defense 5. Health 40, Endurance 50. TV 14.

